      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix\n$C=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{aligned}].$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we find the matrix $\\,C-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nC-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5}-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5}-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (\\sqrt{5}-\\lambda )(-3-\\lambda )-0\\cdot 0 & =0 \\\\ (\\sqrt{5}-\\lambda )(3+\\lambda ) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
